      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "This matter is taken up through Hybrid arrangement (video conferencing/physical mode).\nSince one of the offences is under section 376(3) of the Indian Penal Code, let an extra copy of the bail application along with all its annexures be served on the learned counsel for the State by tomorrow (09.10.2024), who shall send the same to the Inspector in-charge of Kabisurya Nagar Police Station for its service on the informant (in Kabisurya Nagar P.S. Case No.334 of 2020)\nintimating him that the matter will be taken up on 08.11.2024 and if he so likes, he can engage a counsel to oppose the prayer for bail.",
